*  a custom spiceinit file for IHP-Open-PDK 

set ngbehavior=hsa
set num_threads=1
set ng_nomodcheck

* add OSDI: PSP103 compiled with the OpenVAF build of the selected toolchain. The Makefile exports
* OSDI_DIR (tools/toolchain.py path osdi-dir <toolchain>, filled by `make osdi`).
osdi  '$OSDI_DIR/psp103.osdi'
osdi  '$OSDI_DIR/psp103_nqs.osdi'
